    "summary": "Bearer: a **THOUSAND SONS** model.\n\nOnce per battle, for your whole army, while the bearer's unit is **[unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** during [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), you can trigger this ability. That unit then:\n\n- goes into **[Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**\n- gets **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** until [your next Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase)\n- has to arrive with an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), even in your first turn",
